Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:00:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: stream raw IMU + mag over USB Serial/JTAG for the
 SPM hip rig

All USB output after boot is framed (A5 96 type len payload crc16), including
ESP_LOG text, so the PC can decode 240 Hz raw samples without log lines
corrupting them. The UART link to Avionics C is unchanged.

